2 Assumptions and Justifications
     To simplify the problem, we make the following basic assumptions, each of which is
properly justified. Additional, more specific assumptions will be introduced as needed to refine




                                                      型
our models.
⚫ Assumption 1: There will be no changes to the list of sports announced for the 2028 Los




                                                    模
    Angeles Olympics.
    Justification: This assumption means that we assume that all new or existing Olympic




                                                  学
    sports will not undergo any changes before the 2028 Los Angeles Olympics, i.e. no new
    sports will be added and no existing sports will be deleted or canceled. This assumption
    helps us to simplify the model and to focus on existing data and known changes to the




                                                数
    Olympic sports.
⚫ Assumption 2: New projects will have less impact on non-winning countries

                                            ：
    Justification: We assume that for countries that have not yet won an Olympic medal, the




                                           el s
    addition of new sport will not immediately change their chances of winning a medal. These
                                          号
    countries may be able to compete for medals in some of the new sports, but given their




                                         od
    overall strength and athlete pool, the impact of the new sports is expected to be small,
    especially in the short term.
                           众

⚫ Assumption 3: Assuming that the level of sports in each country remains stable.
                                      Hm
    Justification: This assumption means that we assume that there will be no significant
              公


    changes in the level of athletes ( including skill, fitness, athleticism, etc. ) in the different
    Olympic sports in each country.
